         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### What Are We Practicing?\n\nIn this game you practice turning a quantity into a sequence of marks, as some ancient peoples did on bones. You also practice counting on your fingers and, when the quantity grows, on a second pair of hands.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
